						294
					],
					"label":"STRING",
					"type":"STRING",
					"localized_name":"STRING"
				}
			],
			"color":"#322",
			"widgets_values":[
				"subject_definitions:\n<Subject 1> is the cat-ear maid girl from <Picture 1>, same as episode 1.\n<Subject 2> is cute holographic UI elements — a clear image that gets progressively noisier step by step, little noise particles raining down, a progress bar counting up, floating text labels, sparkles.\n<Subject 3> is the same dreamy pink bedroom from <Picture 3> — pink canopy with fairy lights, pink bedding, ornate white headboard, nightstand with flowers, round wall lamp, warm pink glow.\n<Picture 1> is the character reference sheet for <Subject 1>.\n<Picture 3> is the pink bedroom reference.\n\nsummary:\n[reference generation] Episode 2 of a 4-part series. A 15-second cute educational video in medium close-up, pink bedroom, where <Subject 1> explains the forward diffusion process — adding noise step by step until the image becomes pure static. Analogy: like dropping ink into clear water. Holographic animation shows a cute image getting noisier and noisier. No on-screen subtitles. All dialogue in Chinese.\n\nretention_analysis:\n<Subject 1> (appears in [Shot 1], [Shot 2], [Shot 3]): partially_preserved - bust shot, sitting on bed, gesturing, expressions playful to demonstrative.\n<Subject 2> (appears in [Shot 1], [Shot 2], [Shot 3]): fully generated - progressive noise animation, ink-drop analogy visual.\n<Subject 3> (appears in [Shot 1], [Shot 2], [Shot 3]): fully_preserved - pink canopy bedroom as background.\n<Picture 1>: partially_preserved - bust shot, pink bedroom setting.\n<Picture 3>: partially_preserved - room reference maintained.\n\ndetailed_description:\nBright cute kawaii explainer style, medium close-up, pink bedroom. Picks up where episode 1 left off — the hologram is still showing noisy static, <Subject 1> still sitting on the pink bed.\n[Shot 1] <Subject 1> (S1) sits on the pink bed, the noisy hologram from last time still floating beside her, the fairy lights twinkling behind. She points at it and shakes her finger playfully. She says in Chinese, <d>[Chinese] 刚才说的第一步呀，叫做\"前向扩散\"~</d>\n[Shot 2] At 00:05.000, she claps her hands once — and the hologram resets to a clear, cute picture of a puppy. Then she mimics sprinkling something with her fingers, and little colorful noise particles rain down onto the holographic puppy, covering it step by step. A little progress bar appears on the hologram: 25% → 50% → 75% → 100%. The canopy lights twinkle faster as the noise increases. She says in Chinese, <d>[Chinese] 就像是往清水里滴墨水，越滴越浑~ 给图片一点点加噪声，加呀加呀，最后就变成了一团纯噪声！</d>\n[Shot 3] At 00:10.000, the holographic puppy is now 100% pure static noise, completely unrecognizable. She holds up both hands dramatically, like \"ta-da!\", and the pure noise hologram glows brightly. She says in Chinese, <d>[Chinese] 你看，好好的一张图，就这么变成雪花啦~ 那接下来怎么办呢？</d> She tilts her head, cat ear twitching, looking curious. Pink sparkles drift.\n\noverall_soundscape:\nDreamy pink bedroom ambience, soft clap sound, gentle sprinkling/rain sound for noise particles, ascending \"ding\" at 100%, her cheerful Chinese voice, cute sound effects. No music, no subtitles.\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\nN/A"
			],
